  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Diplomatic Academy</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the proposed cooperation between the Netherlands and Algeria is twofold:&#x2022; to develop the capacity of the Algerian Institut Diplomatique et des relations Internationales (IDRI), share best practices in diplomatic training for this &amp; support IDRI in setting up a diplomatic think tank; &#x2022; to strengthen the diplomatic and bilateral relations between the Netherlands and Algeria.The ultimate goal is to improve the quality of the training programs organised by IDRI, its ability to operate as a diplomatic knowledge and experience centre and its adjustment to the needs of modern 21st century diplomacy.</narrative>
  </description>
